flowchart TB
    subgraph UI[产品体验层 · Next.js / React]
        Editor[沉浸式写作区<br/>卷章树 · Markdown · 9 个 AI 入口]
        Inbox[创作收件箱<br/>灵感 · 待确认设定 · 问题]
        Knowledge[知识与历史<br/>知识卡 · Prompt 回放 · SourceRef]
        Workbench[智能体工作台<br/>单章/批量抽取 · 候选审核]
        Monitor[任务监控与设置<br/>节点拓扑 · NDJSON 事件 · 模型配置]
    end

    subgraph API[API 与组合根 · FastAPI]
        ChapterAPI[chapters · outline]
        WritingAPI[writing-ai · ai-cards]
        KnowledgeAPI[inbox · knowledge]
        AgentAPI[agent-workbench · agent-tasks]
        ExportAPI[export · rebuild]
        Composition[main.py<br/>依赖注入 · CapabilityContext · Registry]
    end

    subgraph APP[应用层]
        WritingLoop[编辑器写作闭环<br/>上下文构建 → 事实检索 → Prompt 路由 → LLM → 结构化输出]
        CardLoop[结果卡闭环<br/>AIResultCard → 插入正文 / 灵感 / PendingFact]
        Extraction[知识沉淀 Agent<br/>预处理 → 抽取 → 专家 → 校验 → 冲突 → 审核项]
        AuthorGate[作者审核闸门<br/>新建 / 更新 / 编辑确认 / 拒绝]
        PluginRuntime[插件运行时<br/>发现与注册分离 · Protocol · 能力校验]
    end

    subgraph INFRA[基础设施层]
        LLM[LangChainLLMAdapter<br/>DeepSeek]
        Storage[ProjectAssetStorageBackend<br/>JsonStorageBackend]
        Retrieval[SQLite FTS<br/>ProjectionRebuilder]
        Events[AgentTaskEventCenter<br/>JsonAgentRunStore]
        KnowledgeRepo[JSONKnowledgeRepository<br/>当前兼容实现]
    end

    subgraph DATA[数据宪法]
        Markdown[Markdown 正文<br/>唯一文本事实源]
        Workspace[Workspace JSONL<br/>非事实工作区资产]
        Derived[Derived JSON<br/>AgentRun / 审核项 / LLM 轨迹]
        Mongo[(MongoDB<br/>目标结构事实源)]
        Generated[Generated<br/>SQLite/FTS · Vector · ES · Graph · Cache]
    end

    UI --> API
    API --> APP
    WritingLoop --> CardLoop
    CardLoop --> AuthorGate
    Extraction --> AuthorGate
    APP --> INFRA
    Storage --> Markdown
    Storage --> Workspace
    Events --> Derived
    KnowledgeRepo -.兼容迁移.-> Mongo
    Markdown --> Generated
    Mongo -.目标投影.-> Generated
    Generated --> WritingLoop

